<title>USA: D.C. $70 mln bond deal yields 5.875 pct in 2026.</title>
<headline>D.C. $70 mln bond deal yields 5.875 pct in 2026.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Tuesday it tentatively priced $70 million District of Columbia bonds, for American University, at a top yield of 5.875 percent in 2026.</p>
<p>The preliminary pricing follows:</p>
